[l_english.STATE_LORE_459]
Just as villains in some cartoons spend 24 or even 25 episodes plotting a scheme, only to fail in less than two; the School of Friendship took over two years to build and prosper, only to be leveled by a demolition crew in five minutes. This old-era School of Friendship was naturally abandoned for its “narrow and outdated” view of friendship, yet even as ruins, it never ceased educating ponies. It became the last spiritual sanctuary for ponies who still held hope and nostalgia for the old Harmonism.
Members of the resistance sometimes visit here, forest creatures occasionally pass by, and even many young ponies from the Empire, confused about the true meaning of friendship, still secretly come to seek a trace of ancient wisdom from the broken stones. Though only crumbling walls remain, they always find enlightenment here: Harmony isn’t tied to a specific building, and friendship exists in every corner of the world.
Friendship exists in every corner of the world, and that’s a profoundly true statement. Because even in ruins, you can always find your very own Ministry of Order police to escort you to the Friendship Re-education Center.

[l_simp_chinese.STATE_LORE_459]
正如在一些动画中，反派们会花费24甚至25集来筹划一场阴谋，然后总会在不到两集内失败；友谊学校的建成与繁荣花费了两年多的时间，却在五分钟内被拆迁队夷为平地。这所旧时代的友谊学校自然因其“狭隘且过时”的友谊观而遭到废弃，但直到成为废墟，这座学校也并未停止对小马们的教育。这里成为了对旧日的谐律主义仍抱有希望与怀念的小马们最后的精神圣地。
抵抗军的成员有时会造访这里，森林中的生物们有时会路过这里，甚至是来自于帝国的许多对友谊的真正含义感到困惑的年轻小马，至今仍会偷偷来到这里，试图从残破的石块中寻找一丝旧日的教诲。虽然这里如今只剩下了残垣断壁，但他们总能成功在这里找到启迪：谐律并不依附于某个具体的建筑、友谊存在世界上的每个角落。
友谊存在世界上的每个角落，这是一个无比深刻的道理。这是因为，即使在一片废墟中，你也总能找到属于自己的秩序部警察，将你带去友谊再教育中心。
